{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20287","headline":"送远曲 · 张籍","name":"送远曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吴门向西流水长，水长柳暗烟茫茫。\n行人送客各惆怅，话离叙别倾清觞。\n吟丝竹，鸣笙簧，酒酣性逸歌猖狂。\n行人告我挂帆去，此去何时返故乡。\n殷勤振衣两相嘱，世事近来还浅促。\n愿君看取吴门山，带雪经春依旧绿。\n行人行处求知亲，送君去去徒酸辛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20287.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20287","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}